    {
      "key": "lead",
      "type": "lead",
      "title": "ABOUT",
      "text": "**synthwerk-studio** is the public site, the landing page builder and the admin dashboard of the [synthwerk](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk) stack. It is also the app shell for SDK apps. Today it is a skeleton, cleaned to the bone on purpose. The bones are good."
    },
    {
      "key": "what",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "THE SHORT VERSION",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "One app, three surfaces",
          "text": "One Nuxt 4 app serves three surfaces: public site, page builder, admin dashboard."
        },
        {
          "lead": "App shell",
          "text": "The same app is the shell for SDK apps."
        },
        {
          "lead": "German and English",
          "text": "Prerendered pages in German and English. Dark mode follows the system."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Accessible",
          "text": "Accessibility to WCAG 2.2 AA."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Privacy",
          "text": "Consent per German GDPR law."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Not yet",
          "text": "None of this runs yet. The rewrite is epic E4 Studio core."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "startnotes",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHAT YOU GET",
      "columns": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Nothing runs",
          "text": "Nothing installs and nothing runs. There is no code to run. The quick start is: get the skeleton, look at it."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Read the map first",
          "text": "The ecosystem map is [synthwerk](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk)."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Blueprint",
          "text": "Shared CI, lint configs and templates: [synthwerk-blueprint](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk-blueprint)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "hownotes",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHO TALKS TO WHOM",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Browsers",
          "text": "Browsers talk to studio only. Studio talks to the services."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Login",
          "text": "`synthwerk-identity` provides login, users and roles."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Chat and AI",
          "text": "`synthwerk-llm` provides chat and AI settings."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Live health",
          "text": "Live health streams from `synthwerk-pulse` over SSE."
        }
      ]
    },
